{"data":{"home":{"data":{"attributes":{"allMetaData":{"metaTitle":"ARTEX GM | The First Art Trading Venue","metaDescription":"Democratising art investment. Invest in masterpieces through art shares on ARTEX, the art trading multilateral trading facility.","metaImage":{"data":null,"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"keywords":"Democratise investment in art, art investment, fine art market, investment in iconic art, MTF, Multilateral Trading Facility, trade art shares, artex global markets, trading, artex gm, investment, masterpieces, iconic art, artwork","__typename":"ComponentSharedSeo"},"Hero":{"background_video":"https://player.vimeo.com/progressive_redirect/playback/951423010/rendition/1080p/file.mp4?loc=external&signature=5acbc2aae547897eb5a6b8dcfec1bf43f2ba7292e9a6f2e6819df8692374c75d","background_visual":{"data":null,"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"background_visual_mobile":{"data":null,"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"link":{"label":"Equities Trading","url":"/equities","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsLink"},"text":"Invest in iconic masterpieces <br> on the world's first art multitrading facility.","title":"The Fine Art<br>Trading Venue","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsHero"},"ListBlocs":[{"link":{"label":"Learn more","url":"/how-to-list","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsLink"},"text":"Click and discover the process of how to sell your owned masterpieces.","title":{"subtitle":"HOW TO LIST","title":"Sell Your<br>Masterpieces","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTitle"},"visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"image 38 (1).png","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/image_38_1_3e18fb30cc.png","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTextImage"},{"link":{"label":"Read More","url":"/trading-information","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsLink"},"text":"Find all information related to memberships, trading, and fees.","title":{"subtitle":"MEMBERS AND INVESTORS","title":"Trading Information","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTitle"},"visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"image 23.png","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/image_23_f4e90b9e17.png","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTextImage"},{"link":{"label":"Contact us","url":"/contact","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsLink"},"text":"Through securitisation, ARTEX will make the art market accessible and investable just as Gold (ETF in early 2000) and Real Estate (REIT in 1960).","title":{"subtitle":"get started","title":"Unlock the<br>Value of Art","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTitle"},"visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"image 32 (1).png","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/image_32_1_3925bb1024.png","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTextImage"}],"cards":[{"text":"ARTEX is regulated by the Financial Market Authority (FMA) in Liechtenstein and compliant with the Markets in Financial Instruments Directive (MiFID II).","title":"REGULATED","__typename":"ComponentDataVisionCards"},{"text":"ARTEX will bring much needed liquidity to the art market, making it quick and easy for investors to buy and sell shares in iconic masterpieces.","title":"LIQUIDITY","__typename":"ComponentDataVisionCards"},{"text":"Listed masterpieces will be displayed in museums around the world for all to appreciate.","title":"IMPACT","__typename":"ComponentDataVisionCards"},{"text":"Through fractionalisation, ARTEX will enable with those of modest means to invest in world-renowned art works for the first time. Experienced investors will be able to gain exposure to a wider array of artists’ works with much smaller investment outlays.","title":"FRACTION","__t